The plugin embeds the following third-party font, modified (a subset):

Noto Sans Mono Bold, version 2.006 (a subset: Basic Latin, Latin-1, Latin Extended-A,
typographic quotes and dashes, the euro sign and arrows; no hinting, no layout features)
  https://github.com/notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic
  Copyright 2015 Google LLC. All Rights Reserved.
  Licence: SIL Open Font License, version 1.1 (OFL-1.1), without a Reserved Font Name - the
  full text is panel/annotation-font.OFL.txt and https://openfontlicense.org.
  Files: font/annotation-font.ttf (the source, not shipped as a file), shipped as a data URL in
  panel/annotation-font.css and embedded in component.wasm

The plugin's panel (panel/dist/panel.js, panel/dist/panel.css) is built with Vite from web/src
and bundles third-party code unchanged: Vue, Nuxt UI and the packages they use (reka-ui,
Floating UI, VueUse, tailwind-variants, unhead, colortranslator and others), the compiled styles
of Tailwind CSS, and a selection of Lucide icons (from @iconify-json/lucide). Each is under the
MIT License, colortranslator under the Apache License 2.0, Lucide under the ISC License (and the
MIT License for the icons derived from Feather). The name, version and full licence text of
every bundled package is in panel/dist/THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.txt, which the build writes beside
the panel.
